## Running locally (Windows)

**venv** at `.venv` — do not recreate unless asked.

```powershell
# API (port 8001 if 8000 busy; see frontend/vite.config.ts proxy)
.\.venv\Scripts\python -m uvicorn api.main:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8001

# Frontend
cd frontend
npm run dev
# → http://localhost:5173
```

Production: `npm run build` then uvicorn serves `frontend/dist` from `api/main.py`.

